      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think having an option that changes what category the camera shutter falls under is a bit clunky, especially now that it's being put back into UI sounds. \n\nThat being said I do really love the idea of making this multi-option rather than a bool, only because it could contain a \"Friends only\" option. I find it odd that the toggle doesn't already have that.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
