  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-03-27T07:57:21.971Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since the developers want so hard to keep the camera sound in the world category, i suggest giving us a multi-options toggle instead of just a supress option, as i show in the example image below.\n\nOff: an override option that will disable the camera shutter even if the World sound slider is maxed out.\n\nOn: an override option that will do the opposite of the Off option (even with World sound slider muted, we'll still be able to hear remote players cameras).\n\nWorld Volume: what will define the shutter sound volume will be the World sound slider.\n\nSeriously, why not just more audio settings? Personally i want to disable the loading screen music while also be able to hear the UI sounds. I also want to hear camera shutter sounds while worlds are muted.",
